            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are analyzing a meeting transcript. Extract: 1) a short overall meeting summary (2-3 sentences), 2) a list of action items, each with: owner (person responsible, or 'Unassigned' if unclear), task (clear one-line description), deadline (YYYY-MM-DD format if mentioned, else empty string), priority (High, Normal, or Low based on urgency language). Respond with valid JSON only, no markdown, no code fences, in this exact shape: {\"summary\": string, \"actionItems\": [{\"owner\": string, \"task\": string, \"deadline\": string, \"priority\": string}]}."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Meeting: {{$json.meetingTitle}}\n\nTranscript:\n{{$json.transcriptText}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
